    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i want them to feel more \"real\" though. like, if you were looking at a crowd of them, what would you actually see? i want to be able to describe their skin, hair, and just general \"look\" so they don't just look like generic sci-fi people. what kind of features would make them look like they've been through a lot of hardship or come from a different background than the elites?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
