      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To ground them in reality, imagine their skin bearing distinct \"opacities\" and cold, mineral-like patches that slowly spread, a byproduct of constant exposure to industrial nanites designed to scour them bare. Their hair might be achingly brittle and fall out in thick, dark clumps, replaced by rough, synchronized weaves woven from repurposed cabling that scream for removal despite their cultural acceptance. Visually, they appear less composed than light-shiny elites; instead, they look as though they are constantly repairing invisible fractures in their very structure, perhaps soles of feet scarred from floor-level dust that never quite washes clean enough.",
